---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Freelance Copywriter">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="py-16 text-center lg:text-left">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-600 tracking-wide uppercase eyebrow mb-2">Freelance copywriter</p>
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-6xl mb-6">
        Get the edge with human flair
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-xl text-slate-600 lede mb-8 max-w-3xl">
        Your competitors are all making the same mistake: relying on tired AI clichés that say nothing about their business. This is your chance to stand out — copy that's driven results from global newsrooms to sports disruptors, fresh, fearless, and authentic, just like your brand.
      </p>
      
      <div class="mt-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Brands I've worked with</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-8">
          Your brand deserves copy that's unique to you, and compelling to everyone. AI will never really sound like you — I will.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 bg-indigo-50 rounded-2xl p-8 lg:p-12">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-600 tracking-wide uppercase eyebrow mb-2">Why not just use AI?</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Your big idea deserves better than slop</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-lg text-slate-700">
          <p class="block">Your company is built on an idea that's unique, ambitious and built on rigorous research.</p>
          <p class="block">You <em>could</em> settle for AI slop. Lots of other people have made that choice. But AI will never really sound like you.</p>
          <div class="block callout bg-white p-6 rounded-lg border border-indigo-100 shadow-sm mt-8 font-medium text-indigo-900">
            By working with me, your brand will get the copy it deserves — unique to you, compelling to everyone.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
